+# One leg's frame (portrait_body.c legs): origin the foot, x 256 = the leg's radius (mirrored on the
+# left leg), y -256 = the hip, y 0 = the foot. Drawn after the bare leg, under the bottom and the shoes,
+# in the legwear colour (the creator's "Legwear col." row). Legs show on the figure, the fighter and
+# the chibi, never on the bust, so the blocks skip the bust.
